    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/6e45799313e090a91afdca5580b1db21.avif?t=1750844509\" /></div><br><br><br><strong>Dodging is the best weapon</strong><br>Dodge attacks to survive and trick your enemies into killing each other<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/d42f7852e6a8c6cce2748a1a21a885e1.poster.avif?t=1750844509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/d42f7852e6a8c6cce2748a1a21a885e1.webm?t=1750844509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/d42f7852e6a8c6cce2748a1a21a885e1.mp4?t=1750844509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Delivery is the key</strong><br>Steal containers and deliver them<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/c7e7d5f0fa1bae856df65bfeece7d895.poster.avif?t=1750844509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/c7e7d5f0fa1bae856df65bfeece7d895.webm?t=1750844509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/c7e7d5f0fa1bae856df65bfeece7d895.mp4?t=1750844509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Upgrade or Score</strong><br>Use your stealed containers to upgrade your ship or improve your score<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804270/extras/e6b5d3560ff8341186a3ef0f0b64cc95.poster.avif?t=1750