    "short_description": "Swordship is a roguelike where dodging is your best weapon. Trick your enemies into killing each other, steal containers to upgrade your ship and unlock new ways to play. Dodge, dive, die, learn, repeat.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis game is a\u00a0marvel. [...] Brisk, stylish and compulsive, this is everything an arcade game should be!\u201d<br>ESSENTIAL \u2013 EuroGamer<br><br>\u201c[Swordship] isn't a marathon, but an exhilarating sprint!\u201d<br>8 \u2013 EDGE<br><br>\u201c[...] one of the most inventive and polished indie games of 2022. [...] At its high points, it offers the most thrilling and satisfying experiences of the year.\u201d<br>Forbes<br>",
